[{"title":"李才翁懒窝 其二","author":"林宪","text":"幽人肯一杯，受用今夜月。\n携手步虚庭，履遍沙界雪。\n疏林寂无声，细虫吟自切。\n浩荡天宇开，虚襟共明洁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28736,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芭蕉","author":"林宪","text":"芭蕉我所爱，明洁而中虚。\n禅房富灵根，颇似人清臞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28737,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"使君沈虞卿宗丞命赋郡圃罗汉树其树叶如杨梅经冬不彫生子若罗汉然使君云奇特古怪前所未见也","author":"林宪","text":"参云亭前罗汉树，非桧非杉独雄据。\n苍皮剥落珊瑚寒，错节轮囷海花蠹。\n修圆佛指叶沃光，刺历虾筒槎倒竖。\n铜柯不受鸱蝮穿，翠葆还容藤蔓附。\n藏牙敛翼方屈蟠，奋鬣张鳞忽驰骛。\n突如破浪六鳌回，蜿若惊雷蛰蛟煦。\n摩空飕飕永夏凉，薄雾惨惨晚秋雨。\n白猿叫月时出没，紫凤栖烟乍飞举。\n开花琐碎儿女笑，结子模糊罗汉具。\n威仪庄肃初入定，向背跏趺欣共住。\n蒙头大似安禅时，瞑目还同摩顶处。\n得非天台五百仙，此地钵提曾得度。\n偶然一念落树石，不觉形骸成布露。\n何时收拾过石桥，未免根株伴龙顾。\n更疑地主屈将军，开辟岩荒肇城宇。\n剪除魔怪迎道猷，飞锡半千此焉驻。\n神通堕在造化中，千载英灵飞不去。\n犀坚久矣耐风霆，樗散非徒免斤斧。\n盆山秀耸不足论，猊座婆娑通一路。\n峥嵘下笑桃李繁，奇怪应须鬼神护。\n使君自是名世才，善政报成多暇豫。\n悠然领客上参云，篆隶传观酒深注。\n平生好古丘壑会，指树轩渠命之赋。\n我无文章光燄长，搜搅经时乏佳趣。\n昨宵梦游兹树巅，环视溪山莽回互。\n上云变幻舞龙鸾，下风清和写韶濩。\n最高峰在樛枝底，方广寺随纤叶寓。\n一枝一叶一沙界，应供各谈无义句。\n启予一啸谁划然，八表泠泠树掀翥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28738,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姑苏道中 其一","author":"林宪","text":"理棹出盘门，蓬窗挂秋晓。\n芦花一溪雨，淅沥秋欲老。\n念世多閒愁，居山未为好。\n寒坐橹不鸣，蛩声乱衰草。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28739,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"姑苏道中 其二","author":"林宪","text":"愁来雨声悲，愁去雨声好。\n忽然扣舷歌，云雾生缥缈。\n日夕风雨寒，园林阒如扫。\n静坐观物化，荣谢亦草草。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28740,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读陶诗作","author":"林宪","text":"吾观渊明诗，了不在言赋。\n有如太和气，周行不停驻。\n时与春为风，融夷物华布。\n而未见用力，万物向荣处。\n时与秋为月，浩然无点注。\n江山滋清绝，宇宙靡纤污。\n乃知渊明诗，本不在诗故。\n邂逅吐所有，气象随所寓。\n乞食不为拙，华轩不为慕。\n归来不为高，折腰不为沮。\n羲皇平步超，无怀贞雅素。\n简澹岂能尽，学者漫驰步。\n独有无弦琴，明明一斑露。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28741,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兜率寺作 其一","author":"林宪","text":"归云薄如雾，徐行江上山。\n徘徊印松竹，轻风约之还。\n悠然渡江去，馀影犹阑斑。\n白鸟更自在，几点落远滩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28742,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兜率寺作 其二","author":"林宪","text":"月色到江上，角声过山来。\n山城半绿树，佳处仍楼台。\n古屋翠微顶，疏檐宜晚开。\n隐几月入座，山长潮信回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28743,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梁源异松图行为台州赵别驾作","author":"林宪","text":"座中忽觉林樾幽，怪松堕前惊两眸。\n孤根蟠错涌鳞鬣，百干奋跃纷戈矛。\n千岁之柯海波捲，十亩之阴岚霭浮。\n上云变幻舞鸾鹄，下风哮吼搏蛟虬。\n影入月窟兔缩距，声撼水府鲸掉头。\n初夏花黄醍醐结，四时芽茁绀绿抽。\n嘘晴噀雨莽奇怪，摇山荡海寒飕飗。\n天开地辟何日种，阴惨阳舒谩神搜。\n乡闾讽诵喜辄应，僧伽护爱诃不休。\n得非孔明庙前铜柯柏，元气淋漓钟此夫焉廋。\n得非道者庵边隔世植万本，伦魁飞来排斡予交樛。\n安得此松据此地，轮囷傲蹇无侣俦。\n我尝两赋罗汉树，诗人许我不但杨与尤。\n一在天台匿峰千岭顶，芘覆方广之寺瀑布流。\n一与郡治参云亭对峙，白猿啼蹶忽惊紫凤留。\n因知三台气忠厚，何但当代人材优。\n至于树木亦豪伟，岁寒动足光林丘。\n问诸故老考初始，或云五季方栽培。\n黄宋恶迹寺傍庙，野僧无知但包羞。\n又云道人梁君隐唐末，建立鼎灶结茅深岩陬。\n与二道伴王与白，赤铅紫汞火候卦气周。\n千日丹成各升举，舍庵为寺答应求。\n后人诞谩附名号，妄踪狂躅何悠悠。\n当时丹气蒸山一乡植物茂，丹液入根独此偃盖稠。\n势蟠形踞抱龙虎，梢圆叶厚缀球旒。\n芘民曾却白额虎，供桃时下青茸猴。\n四百馀年颇灵异，图经不载记不收。\n贤哉赵公眼高远，褒贬万态如春秋。\n一见指呼韦偃辈，咄嗟而办造化侔。\n竭囊底智老我语，搜搅造化正恐神鬼愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28744,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"林宪","text":"野梅空山中，正为照人开。\n如何绿窗底，疏映带苍苔。\n颇似古君子，无人自不谐。\n竹径酒初醒，一信清香来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28745,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二首 其二","author":"林宪","text":"池边石陂陀，水光上梅梢。\n石上古隶字，藓剥风萧骚。\n树老花秀发，冰生香动摇。\n只恐字磨灭，不愁花寂寥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28746,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花二首 其一","author":"林宪","text":"凌晨汲山泉，盥洗甫云暇。\n徐行修竹间，小立疏梅罅。\n尖风耿薄日，色影寒相射。\n幽香定有无，纹禽踏花卸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28747,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪巢三首 其三","author":"林宪","text":"凡草占眼界，凿池松竹间。\n寒添一方月，香润九畹兰。\n蓼蘋稍自出，鸥鹭去亦还。\n水云万里趣，不待涉江山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28748,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪巢三首 其二","author":"林宪","text":"采兰以纫佩，不久香消歇。\n何如深林中，岁寒自时节。\n清芳御微风，幽态含皎月。\n世或无骚人，宁甘伴冰雪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28749,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪巢三首 其一","author":"林宪","text":"居闲我所愿，谋拙人所虑。\n平淡固可嘉，饥来欲谁诉。\n八十日彭泽，四十年郑圃。\n前贤去就意，三复成喜惧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28750,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪巢即事","author":"林宪","text":"幽居閟古寺，隙地滋春绿。\n汲水延晚花，推窗数新竹。\n嘉蔬喜晨餐，小雨昨夜足。\n傥使多暇时，终甘食无肉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28751,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓天台水南四首 其三","author":"林宪","text":"春雨暗前山，春云行远林。\n月落鸡犬静，谁闻梁甫吟。\n巍巍兮高山，泠泠兮好音。\n谁闻梁甫吟，惟恐山不深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28752,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓天台水南四首 其四","author":"林宪","text":"夔皋不著书，周召不决科。\n端坐庙堂上，四海臻泰和。\n此道固如是，后来文艺多。\n嗒然空山中，独抱明良歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28753,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓天台水南四首 其二","author":"林宪","text":"怀古不知寒，洗心忘百忧。\n怡然方寸地，得与贤圣游。\n南涧兮泉甘，北山兮云幽。\n彼纷兮何之，兹盘兮吾留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28754,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓天台水南四首 其一","author":"林宪","text":"小雨凄暮春，入夜寒更作。\n泠泠竹间风，振我衣袂薄。\n野田鸣流泉，密树纷翠幄。\n蹑屐徐我行，长怀付寥廓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28755,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游芮湾东山庵","author":"林宪","text":"晴暾上疏林，石径铺松影。\n挽衣涉寒涧，扪萝过重岭。\n闲花袅幽妍，冶叶发青炯。\n欲访隐者居，鸡声出烟暝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28756,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题国清寺清音亭 其二","author":"林宪","text":"困来石上眠，梦绕泉石閒。\n山鬼按玉徽，山灵铿佩环。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28757,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题国清寺清音亭 其一","author":"林宪","text":"水从东塔来，却打西涧过。\n八万四千偈，为我细说破。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28758,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"林宪","text":"一夜相思笑玉川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28759,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"林宪","text":"天空霜无影。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28760,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"林宪","text":"绝无声色动凡情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28761,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"林宪","text":"桃花飞后杨花飞，杨花飞后无可飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28762,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游虎丘 其一","author":"林拱中","text":"白虎岩前秋已阑，黑云疏雨洗林峦。\n铁花烟落石泉冷，羽井苔深霜月寒。\n隐浦疾帆风去饱，疏寮森木晓催丹。\n清斋不许盘餐入，辜负湖山冷淡看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28763,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游虎丘 其二","author":"林拱中","text":"我来一榻羡危亭，倦步支颐竹杖轻。\n僧听钟声归寺急，鸦争林宿压枝鸣。\n禅机击拨如锋起，尘袂驱除似水清。\n风定夜虚声转寂，杯茶精舍一灯明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28764,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送陈吏部","author":"林某","text":"天颁一札语叮咛，光动郎官驾使星。\n赖有斯文增气燄，可无吾道活生灵。\n驰驱漫说周原隰，登辔先须辨渭泾。\n珍重□章临遣意，不徒盐筴与茶经。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28765,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"旅中","author":"林某","text":"一剑随孤影，风霜道路长。\n何人忽横笛，有客正思乡。\n古驿自芳草，空山又夕阳。\n啼猿莫添恨，今夜宿潇湘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28766,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑞麦赞","author":"林某","text":"淳熙天子，御图三七。\n协气所钟，嘉禾乃出。\n巴夔之山，亘连阡陌。\n或两其歧，或六其脊。\n惟是西门，近郊所植。\n六六同颖，函三为一。\n兹诚创见，图写漏逸。\n乃知人为，不逮天力。\n上方寅畏，摈华务实。\n臣不敢献，私志于室。\n采诗之官，汗青之笔。\n编诸诗书，示此其质。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28767,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"林泉生","text":"桃李公门者，将芜胡不归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28768,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖","author":"林洪","text":"烟生杨柳一痕月，雨弄荷花数点秋。\n此景此时摹不尽，画船归去有渔舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28769,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"折柳","author":"林洪","text":"湖边杨柳色如金，几日不来成绿阴。\n折得柔条入城去，教人知道已春深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28770,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孤山隐居","author":"林洪","text":"为怕因诗题姓名，特寻孤处隐吟身。\n当时祗向梅花说，不道梅花说与人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28771,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钓台","author":"林洪","text":"三聘殷勤起富春，如何一宿便辞君。\n早知闲脚无伸处，只合青山卧白云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28772,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词","author":"林洪","text":"金殿当头紫阁重，仙人掌上玉芙蓉。\n太平天子朝元日，五色云车驾六龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28773,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春宫","author":"林洪","text":"桃李六宫寂，君王在石渠。\n临鸾悔梳洗，女色不如书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28774,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莲房鱼包","author":"林洪","text":"锦□金蓑织几重，问鱼何事得相容。\n涌身既入莲房去，好度华池独化龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28775,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"枕上作","author":"林洪","text":"天街月未沈，来者已骎骎。\n夜若可无睡，人应更有心。\n香凝衾正暖，灯隔帐如阴。\n亦欲呼童起，谁门能赏音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28776,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桐下","author":"林洪","text":"无名花草上闲坡，病叶成堆客罕过。\n注易欠工知学少，种桐收效得阴多。\n破篱自补忧边事，断简重穿忆世科。\n近日转知闲最好，旋沽邻酒谢诗魔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28777,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谋隐","author":"林洪","text":"箧书如叶半飘零，尚自浮家客帝京。\n每遇事添新感慨，怕逢人说旧升平。\n山如有约青常在，发幸相饶白未生。\n便作阴谋犹是晚，栽松何日得阴成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28778,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水仙花","author":"林洪","text":"清真处子面，刚烈丈夫心。\n翠带拖云舞，金卮照雪斟。\n苦吟吟不得，移入伯牙琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28779,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"楼居","author":"林洪","text":"梅边未有屋三间，僦得楼居特暂安。\n天下事非容易说，门前山可久长看。\n瓶花频换春常在，阶草不除秋自残。\n岂是江湖难著脚，如今平地亦狂澜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28780,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"恋绣衾","author":"林洪","text":"冰肌生怕雪未禁。\n翠屏前、短瓶满簪。\n真个是、疏枝瘦，认花儿、不要浪吟。\n等闲蜂蝶都休惹，暗香来、时借水沉。\n既得个、厮偎伴，任风霜、尽自放心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28781,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"林洪","text":"雪翻夜钵裁成玉，春化寒酥剪作金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28782,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 淳祐己酉良月，自淦入桂，舣舟溪浒，有感而作","author":"林革","text":"十载扁舟，几来往、三吾溪上。\n天宝事，一回看著，一回惆怅。\n笔画模糊犹雅健，文章褒贬添悲壮。\n枉教人、字字费沈吟，评轻重。\n西北望，情无量。\n东南气，真长王。\n想忠臣应读，宋中兴颂。\n主圣自然皆乐土，时平正合储良将。\n笑此身、老大尚奔驰，知何用。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28783,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送水云归吴","author":"林顺德","text":"归舟夜泊西兴渡，坐看潮来又潮去。\n江草江花春复春，山青水绿原如故。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28784,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"红叶","author":"林宾旸","text":"五夜霜为染，轻明映碧流。\n山林惊有色，天地欲无秋。\n野渡风初起，夕阳雨未收。\n昔闻供墨客，霜屋落飕飗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28785,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病鹤","author":"林宾旸","text":"松梢秋气怯霜衣，犹为山人守石扉。\n仙国灵丹无处觅，故乡华表几时归。\n心知海上云霄□，眼见林间燕雀飞。\n却恨吹台消息断，草烟城郭照斜晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28786,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石井诗一首","author":"林栗","text":"石井灵踪信不凡，一泓岩下碧深潭。\n谁磨皎洁青铜镜，更琢玲珑碧玉龛。\n濯去衣巾无限垢，漱来齿颊有馀甘。\n悬知坎谷非佳井，寄语诗人莫恨谈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28787,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高宗皇帝挽词 其二","author":"林栗","text":"周汉中兴胜，唐虞内禅高。\n髀消从马腹，屣脱等鸿毛。\n弓剑悲长在，羹墙慕转劳。\n龙髯攀莫及，四海共呼咷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28788,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高宗皇帝挽词 其三","author":"林栗","text":"兼爱无南北，全能冠古今。\n典坟供夜览，烽火自宵沉。\n睿藻成章焕，宸钧寓意深。\n万年垂琬琰，谁识至仁心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28789,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高宗皇帝挽词 其一","author":"林栗","text":"仓猝扶宗社，艰危启圣神。\n英雄归驾御，狂狡愿和亲。\n泛扫妖氛净，恢张治化新。\n倦勤三纪外，头白尽遗民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28790,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"林栗","text":"千年依旧长安土，万里思归帝子家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28791,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"林栗","text":"定王遗筑览长沙，城郭山川四面佳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28792,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘲丁大全 其一","author":"林桂龙","text":"一舵中流欠把持，偏轻偏重失便宜。\n孤舟不是无人渡，身作风波问阿谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28793,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘲丁大全 其三","author":"林桂龙","text":"稚子如何济急流，一篙才错便难收。\n当初把作寻常看，岂料中流解覆舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28794,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘲丁大全 其二","author":"林桂龙","text":"移溪实壑误明君，惊动沿江十万军。\n幸是不沈湘水死，有何面目见灵均。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28795,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题州宅舣阁","author":"林积","text":"济川须用楫，罔水戒行舟。\n四海风波路，安眠是胜游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28796,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书至鹅湖访先祖简肃诗扁岁久不复存矣月老重饰一板令余书楬芝兰室因题二十八字","author":"林致诚","text":"忆昔先翁此地经，曾挥诗笔扫青冥。\n我来遍索前修句，雷电何年敕六丁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28797,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和骆萝宪分水岭诗 其二","author":"林致诚","text":"莫言种木事平平，多少行人上玉京。\n岂惮炎途依密荫，云天大芘尽蒙成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28798,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和骆萝宪分水岭诗 其三","author":"林致诚","text":"照人风骨清如玉，振祖家声远若雷。\n想对旅窗贪读易，不知门外使车来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28799,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和骆萝宪分水岭诗 其一","author":"林致诚","text":"一自端明去外台，脩途松盖属谁栽。\n仁心既许推仁政，玉笋清班趁早排。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28800,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽胡季昭","author":"林起鳌","text":"直节槃槃古树平，纲常山重一身轻。\n历陈高庙神灵语，愿法周公日月更。\n飞雾堕鸢迁客憾，漏泉疏爵大君明。\n百年富贵端能几，天壤无穷独令名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28801,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]